    <section class="sec tinted" id="policy">
      
      <div class="m-policy" id="m-policy"></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="d-policy">
          <div class="sec-head" data-rv="">
            <div>
              <span class="sec-tag"><i class="fi fi-sr-rocket-lunch"></i>六大城市旗艦任務 · A
                BETTER HUALIEN</span>
              <h2 class="sec-title">讓花蓮大步向前</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="sec-more">點旗艦看政見，讓花蓮的每一步都更有力。</span>
          </div>

          
          <div class="six-tabs" id="six-tabs" data-rv=""></div>
          <div class="flag-panel" id="flag-panel" data-rv=""></div>

          
          <div class="gov-panel" data-rv="">
            <button class="gov-strip" type="button" data-c12="gov" data-rv="">
              <span class="gv-sl" hidden>四大治理方向 × 十二項施政領域，管全部的事</span>
              <span><b>完整施政藍圖</b>｜六大旗艦之外，所有縣政每天都要做好的事</span>
              <span class="st">看政見 →</span>
            </button>
            
            <p class="bp-descbar" id="bp-descbar" hidden></p>

            
            <div class="pd-railwrap" data-rv="">
              <button class="pd-arrow prev" type="button" aria-label="往前看政見卡">
                <i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-left"></i>
              </button>
              <button class="pd-arrow next" type="button" aria-label="往後看政見卡">
                <i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i>
              </button>
              <div class="pd-grid">
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p1" data-c12="guard" data-cat="safe">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-shield-check"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">防災</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">成立防災專責單位</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    花蓮天災頻繁，主張成立跨局處統籌的防災專責單位，從救災走向防災、超前部署。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p2" data-c12="guard" data-cat="safe">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-document"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">透明</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">危樓處置與資訊透明</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    加速 0403
                    地震危樓補強或拆除，並全面公開紅單、黃單建築資訊，保障住的安全。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p3" data-c12="gov" data-cat="care">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-gym"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">健康老化</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">長者重訓、預防失能</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    花蓮邁入超高齡社會，推動「長者重量訓練計畫」，從源頭降低失能與跌倒風險。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p4" data-c12="smart" data-cat="care">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-heart"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">守護</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">獨居長者守護系統</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    面對高齡與獨居問題，主張建立獨居長者守護系統、強化社區關懷與智慧健康照護。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p5" data-c12="move" data-cat="move">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-road"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">交通</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">加速建置公共自行車</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    花蓮公共自行車進度落後，主張儘速規劃建置，串聯商圈與景點、強化友善騎乘環境。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p6" data-c12="tour" data-cat="move">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-globe"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">觀光</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">打開對外新航線</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    與其苦守虧損國內航線，主張爭取花蓮直飛日本石垣、宮古等短程國際航線。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p7" data-c12="gov" data-cat="live">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-graduation-cap"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">特教</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">特教助理員月薪制</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    花蓮特教助理員仍採時薪制、寒暑假零收入，主張改採月薪制與完整聘期。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p8" data-c12="gov" data-cat="live">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-stethoscope"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">生活品質</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">小黑蚊科學化防治</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    小黑蚊影響生活與觀光，主張改採科學化、系統性防治，設重點區並編列專案預算監測。
                  </p>
                  <span class="pd-more">看完整政見<i class="fi fi-sr-arrow-small-right"></i></span>
                </button>
                <button class="pd-card" type="button" data-pd="p9" data-c12="gov" data-cat="live">
                  <span class="pd-ic"><i class="fi fi-sr-badge-check"></i></span>
                  <span class="pd-tag">公共安全</span>
                  <h4 class="pd-card-title">寵物源頭管理條例</h4>
                  <p class="pd-card-lead">
                    放養、未繫繩事故頻傳，主張強化自治條例，規範外出繫繩、禁止放養、落實飼主責任。
                  </p>
