    </section>

    
    <section class="sec tinted sp" id="support">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head" data-rv="">
          <div>
            <span class="sec-tag"><i class="fi fi-sr-heart"></i>支持嘉賢 · SUPPORT</span>
            <h2 class="sec-title">一起讓改變發生</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="sec-more">每一份支持，都是花蓮向前的力量</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sp-grid" data-rv="">
          <a class="sp-card sp-link" href="https://win0713.oen.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <i class="fi fi-sr-hand-holding-heart"></i>
            <h3>小額捐款</h3>
            <p>每一筆小額捐款，都是嘉賢往前走的底氣。</p>
